exit: 2
--- stdout
--- stderr
oge: no .oge/oge.toml, and Öge doesn't recognise this project's toolchain (only Go so far).
  Write .oge/oge.toml with at least:

    schema = 1

    [project]
    test_globs = ["<glob matching your test files>"]

    [[check.commands]]
    run    = "<command that runs your tests>"
    report = "junit"   # or "go-test-json"

  or pass --check <command> and --tests <glob> for this Run.
